                <div class="text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 font-mono mt-0.5">$3,850.00 – $3,800.00</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1">Bolsa de liquidez donde cierran los fondos</div>
              </div>
              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-gray-800/60 border border-gray-700">
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-300 font-bold uppercase">Nivel de Invalidez</div>
                <div class="text-sm font-black text-gray-300 font-mono mt-0.5">$4,015.00</div>
                <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1">Cierre H4 arriba cancela el sesgo bajista</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Horarios Peligrosos y Noticias -->
        <div class="bg-cardBg border border-cardBorder rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-gray-800 pb-3">
              <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-5 h-5 text-red-400"></i>
              <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white">Horarios Críticos de la Sesión</h3>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-900/60 text-blue-300 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold">03:00 AM NY</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-white">Apertura de Londres</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Posible falso rompimiento (Judas Swing) del rango asiático.</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-red-950/40 border border-red-500/30 flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-900/80 text-red-200 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold">08:30 AM NY</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-red-400">Noticias de Alto Impacto (NFP/CPI)</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-300 mt-0.5">⚠️ <strong>PROHIBIDO OPERAR</strong> entre 08:25 y 08:45 AM.</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-yellow-950/30 border border-yellow-500/30 flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-yellow-900/60 text-yellow-300 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold">09:30 AM NY</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-bold text-white">Campana de Wall Street</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Ventana de oro para la entrada Sniper en M5 tras la volatilidad inicial.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 text-[11px] text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="info" class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            <span>La disciplina de no operar en noticias protege tu capital del slippage institucional.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- PROTOCOLO SNIPER: 1 TRADE AL DÍA CON R:R >= 1:3 -->
      <section class="bg-cardBg border border-cardBorder rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xl space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-800 pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
              <i data-lucide="crosshair" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-white">Checklist de Confirmación Sniper (1 Solo Trade al Día)</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Marca las casillas. Solo cuando completes los 5 pasos se autoriza la ejecución.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="btnResetChecklist" class="text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-400 hover:text-white px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 hover:border-gray-700 transition flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer shadow-sm" title="Reiniciar casillas">
              <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" class="w-3 h-3 text-yellow-400"></i>
              <span>Reiniciar</span>
            </button>
            <div id="sniperStatusBadge" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs font-mono bg-red-950 text-red-400 border border-red-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
              <i data-lucide="lock" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
              <span id="sniperStatusText">BLOQUEADO (0/5 Requisitos)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5 Steps Checklist -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3" id="sniperChecklistContainer">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <label class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 hover:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-3 transition">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sniper-check mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 cursor-pointer" data-step="1">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
                <span>1. Sesgo & Flujo Macro</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-tight">DXY y US10Y con entrada de capital. Sesgo institucional bajista confirmado.</div>
            </div>
          </label>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <label class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 hover:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-3 transition">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sniper-check mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 cursor-pointer" data-step="2">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span>
                <span>2. Pullback & Agotamiento</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-tight">Retroceso M5 a resistencia ($3,920-$3,950) o EMA 21 con mechas superiores.</div>
            </div>
          </label>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <label class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/90 border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-950/10 hover:border-emerald-500/60 cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-3 transition shadow-sm">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sniper-check mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 cursor-pointer" data-step="3">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-black text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
                <span>3. Gatillo Heikin Ashi</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-300 leading-tight">1ra vela roja HA con <strong>Techo Plano (Flat Top, 0 mecha arriba)</strong> cerrada al segundo :00.</div>
            </div>
          </label>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <label class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 hover:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-3 transition">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sniper-check mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 cursor-pointer" data-step="4">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                <span>4. Ratio R:R ≥ 1:3 Real</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-tight">SL ≤ 35 pips ($3.50) sobre máximo de M5 y TP ≥ 105 pips ($10.50) en broker real.</div>
            </div>
          </label>

          <!-- Step 5 -->
          <label class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 hover:border-gray-700 cursor-pointer flex items-start gap-3 transition">
            <input type="checkbox" class="sniper-check mt-1 w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-800 border-gray-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-emerald-500/20 cursor-pointer" data-step="5">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
                <span>5. Killzone NY (09:45-10:45)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-tight">Sin noticias rojas activas (15 min libres) y antes del London Fix (11:30 NY).</div>
            </div>
          </label>
        </div>

        <!-- GUÍA VISUAL GATILLO HEIKIN ASHI M5 (1 TRADE AL DÍA) -->
        <div class="bg-gray-950/80 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xs font-mono">M5</span>
              <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>Gatillo de Entrada con Velas Heikin Ashi</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 font-mono border border-emerald-500/30">Precisión Quirúrgica</span>
              </h4>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-400 font-bold bg-emerald-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-800">
              Ratio Objetivo: 1:3 Mínimo
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
            
            <!-- Card 1: Patrón Flat Top -->
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-gray-200">1. Vela Roja "Flat Top"</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 font-bold">Venta A+</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                Espera que el precio retroceda (pullback) en M5 hacia la resistencia o EMA 21. La señal se confirma al cerrar la <strong class="text-white">primera vela roja Heikin Ashi SIN mecha superior (Flat Top)</strong>.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-red-300 font-mono bg-red-950/40 p-1.5 rounded border border-red-900/40">
                🛑 Sin mecha superior = Dominio bajista absoluto sin compradores.
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Filtro de Indecisión -->
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-gray-200">2. Filtro Anti-Trampas</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-300 font-bold">Paciencia</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                Si la vela roja tiene mecha arriba y abajo (tipo peonza/Doji), <strong class="text-yellow-400">NO DISPARES</strong>. Indica absorción o rango. Solo entramos cuando el cuerpo se expande con techo plano.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-yellow-300 font-mono bg-yellow-950/40 p-1.5 rounded border border-yellow-900/40">
                ⚠️ Evita entrar en falsos rompimientos o mechas de apertura.
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: Ejecución Broker Real -->
            <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-900/90 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-gray-200">3. Ejecución Broker Real</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 font-bold">Regla de Oro</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                Heikin Ashi se usa <strong class="text-white">únicamente como filtro visual de tendencia</strong>. Tu orden de mercado y Stop Loss deben ser colocadas al precio <strong class="text-blue-400">Bid/Ask real de tu broker</strong>.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-blue-300 font-mono bg-blue-950/40 p-1.5 rounded border border-blue-900/40">
                💡 SL ajustado a 30-35 pips ($3-$3.50) y TP 1:3 ($9-$10.50).
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

<!-- Calculadora Sniper Integrada -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-800 mt-3 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i data-lucide="calculator" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-yellow-400"></i>
              <span>Calculadora Sniper R:R 1:3 para el Trade de Hoy</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-mono">1 trade, 1% de riesgo</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-medium mb-1">Precio Entrada XAU</label>
              <input type="number" id="sniperEntryPrice" step="0.1" value="3950.0" class="w-full bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-white font-mono font-bold focus:border-yellow-500 focus:outline-none">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-medium mb-1">Precio Stop Loss</label>
              <input type="number" id="sniperSlPrice" step="0.1" value="3953.5" class="w-full bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-red-400 font-mono font-bold focus:border-red-500 focus:outline-none">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-[11px] text-gray-400 font-medium mb-1">Riesgo Cuenta (%)</label>
              <input type="number" id="sniperRiskPct" step="0.5" value="1.0" class="w-full bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-white font-mono font-bold focus:border-yellow-500 focus:outline-none">
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-end">
              <button id="btnCalcSniper" class="w-full py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-yellow-400 hover:to-amber-500 text-black font-black text-xs rounded-lg transition shadow-lg shadow-yellow-500/20 cursor-pointer">
                Calcular Objetivos 1:3
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Calculated Results Row -->
          <div id="sniperResultsRow" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-800/80">
            <div class="p-2 rounded bg-gray-800/60 text-center">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Riesgo (Pips)</div>
              <div id="sniperRiskPips" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-white">35 pips (.50)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded bg-gray-800/60 text-center">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400">Lote Recomendado</div>
              <div id="sniperLotResult" class="text-xs font-mono font-black text-yellow-400">0.03 Lots</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-500/20 text-center">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-bold">TP 1:2 (70 pips)</div>
              <div id="sniperTp2Price" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-emerald-300">3943.00</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-500/40 text-center">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-emerald-300 font-black">🎯 TP 1:3 (105 pips)</div>
              <div id="sniperTp3Price" class="text-xs font-mono font-black text-emerald-200">3939.50</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-2 rounded bg-yellow-950/40 border border-yellow-500/30 text-center col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
              <div class="text-[10px] text-yellow-400 font-bold">TP 1:4 (140 pips)</div>
              <div id="sniperTp4Price" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-yellow-300">3936.00</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Transferir al Diario Real con 1 Clic -->
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-gray-800/80">
            <span class="text-[11px] text-gray-400 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400"></i>
              <span>¿Listo para ejecutar este trade en tu broker? Envíalo a tu diario real con 1 clic:</span>
            </span>
            <button id="btnSendSniperToJournal" class="px-3.5 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1.5 transition shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/30 cursor-pointer">
              <i data-lucide="send" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
              <span>Cargar en Diario Real (Pestaña 2)</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- LIVE TRADINGVIEW CHARTS EMBED -->
      

    </div>
  </main>


  <!-- Modal: Editar Operación -->
  <div id="modalEditTrade" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
    <div class="bg-cardBg border border-cardBorder rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="pencil" class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-400"></i>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Editar Operación</h3>
        </div>
        <button id="btnCloseEditModal" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">
          <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <input type="hidden" id="editTradeId">
      <input type="hidden" id="editTradeMode" value="backtest">

      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Stop Loss en Puntos (Oro)</label>
          <input type="number" id="editTradeTvPoints" min="1" step="any" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-mono font-bold text-base" placeholder="ej. 250">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Ratio R:R</label>
          <input type="number" id="editTradeRR" min="0.1" step="0.1" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-blue-400 font-mono font-bold">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Dirección</label>
          <select id="editTradeDirection" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-semibold">
            <option value="BUY">BUY (Posición Larga)</option>
            <option value="SELL">SELL (Posición Corta)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Resultado</label>
          <select id="editTradeStatus" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-bold">
            <option value="win" class="text-emerald-400">WIN (Ganada en TP)</option>
            <option value="loss" class="text-rose-400">LOSS (Perdida en SL)</option>
            <option value="be" class="text-gray-400">BREAKEVEN</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Estrategia / Setup</label>
          <input type="text" id="editTradeStrategy" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Psicología / Disciplina</label>
          <select id="editTradeEmotion" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white">
            <option value="Plan Seguido 100%">🟢 Plan Seguido 100%</option>
            <option value="Paciente (Confirmación)">🟢 Paciente (Confirmación)</option>
            <option value="Entrada Anticipada">🟡 Entrada Anticipada</option>
            <option value="Salida Prematura">🟡 Salida Prematura</option>
            <option value="FOMO">🔴 FOMO</option>
            <option value="Operativa por Venganza">🔴 Operativa por Venganza</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">URL Captura TradingView</label>
          <input type="url" id="editTradeChartUrl" placeholder="https://www.tradingview.com/x/..." class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-2 pt-2">
        <button id="btnSaveEditedTrade" class="flex-1 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition">
          Guardar Cambios
        </button>
        <button id="btnCancelEditTrade" class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-700 text-gray-300 font-medium text-xs rounded-xl transition">
          Cancelar
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: Settings -->
  <div id="modalSettings" class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
    <div class="bg-cardBg border border-cardBorder rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-800 pb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i data-lucide="settings" class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-300"></i>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Parámetros Globales</h3>
        </div>
        <button id="btnCloseSettings" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white">
          <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Capital Inicial (USD)</label>
          <input type="number" id="settingInitialBalance" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-mono" value="110.00">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Riesgo Compuesto por Operación (%)</label>
          <input type="number" id="settingRiskPct" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-mono" value="5.0">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Ratio R:R Predeterminado</label>
          <input type="number" id="settingRR" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-mono" value="1.0">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-gray-400 mb-1">Apalancamiento del Broker</label>
          <input type="number" id="settingLeverage" class="w-full bg-gray-950 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-2 text-white font-mono" value="300">
        </div>
      </div>

      <button id="btnSaveSettings" class="w-full py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition">
        Guardar Configuración
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>